# Witness: a pointer to an int is nulled by zero (seen 1).
# Norm: the book #scope («присваиваются только друг другу и обнуляются»), journal 2026-11-17 #l3-own-types; R51 Q3.
# Slice C2 (plan #one-graph-plan, P1): the check lives in src/l2src/lmx_checks.lm2.
(
    Observed:
        int: seen 0
)
sub: main () (
    int: x 5
    @: q int @x
)
    @: shared node[0]
    q := 0
    shared\Observed\seen := 1
main()
